      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017. Published by Elsevier Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "In this review, we highlight recent studies that advance the knowledge and understanding of the effects of various environmental factors and the associated immune responses in patients with allergic diseases. This review will focus on new literature regarding allergic and immune responses to a variety of environmental factors including aeroallergens, stinging insects, fungi, pollutants, viral respiratory infections, climate change, and microbial exposures."
